WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.868
-Guys, you know every week,
we like to bring you

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:04.503
some uplifting, creative videos,
whether they come from

00:00:04.503 --> 00:00:05.871
quarantine or just
stuff around the country.

00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:07.974
It's time for
"What Are You Doing Wednesday."

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:10.577
-♪ What are you doing
on Wednesday? ♪

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:15.248
♪ What are you doing on
Wednesday? ♪

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:17.883
-First up, this guy got
pretty bored in quarantine

00:00:17.883 --> 00:00:21.254
and discovered an amazing
Siri trick.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:24.391
-Hey, Siri.
[ Phone beeps ]

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:26.960
Change my nickname.
[ Phone beeps ]

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.362
-Okay. What would you
like me to call you?

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:36.769
[ Phone beeps ]
-HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA.

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:38.404
-You would like me to call you

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:41.373
"Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey,
hey, hey, hey, hey, hey,

00:00:41.373 --> 00:00:46.880
hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey,
hey, hey, hey, hey, hey"?

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:47.981
-Yes.

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:51.450
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:54.888
-Hey, that's Mr. Hey, Hey, Hey,
Hey, Hey to you.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.388
Next up, this girl was going for

00:00:56.388 --> 00:00:58.425
the perfect rope-swing picture.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.593
She had her buddy
all planned out to get

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.395
the good close-up slo-mo shot.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:04.464
Well, it didn't go as planned.
Check it out.

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:09.035
-...2, 3...

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:12.438
-Oh!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:16.876
-Did that just [bleep]

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:20.313
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:23.482
And, finally, this baby sister
is not having it

00:01:23.482 --> 00:01:25.251
with her brother's crying.

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:33.359
-[ Crying ]

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:38.964
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.964 --> 00:01:40.266
There you go, everybody.

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:41.935
That is "What Are You
Doing Wednesday."

